<!-- ============================================ -->
<!-- COMPETITIVE ADVANTAGE                        -->
<!-- ============================================ -->

<h2>Our Competitive Advantage &mdash; Built-In Reach Across Alberta</h2>

<p>You don't just get a marketing team. You get immediate access to our owned media platforms. That means reduced paid ad spend and higher ROI from day one.</p>

<div class="value-highlight">
  Your campaign gets organic amplification to 290,000+ Albertans at no additional cost.<br>
  This drastically reduces the paid media you'd need.
</div>

<p>Most agencies charge for every impression. We already have the audience.</p>

